subscription_url.description:
URL to navigate to the subscription in the Agree web app.
Only present when the invoice is part of a recurring subscription (has a recurring schedule).
Format: {base_url}/subscriptions?modal=subscription-details&subscriptionId={invoice_template_id}
Examples:
- https://secure.agree.com/subscriptions?modal=subscription-details&subscriptionId={invoice_template_id}

invoice_url.description:
URL to navigate to the invoice in the Agree web app.
Format: {base_url}/invoices?modal=invoice-details&invoiceId={invoice_id}
Examples:
- https://secure.agree.com/invoices?modal=invoice-details&invoiceId={invoice_id}

docs_url.description:
URL to navigate to the agreement in the Agree web app.
Format: {base_url}/docs/{agreement_id}
Examples:
- https://secure.agree.com/docs/{agreement_id}
